C/ COMPOOL whose structure template contains a label member, so that the
C/ SDF carries a class 5 ("Template label") symbol and ENTER_SDF_LABEL is
C/ reached when it is imported.
 COMPL: COMPOOL;
    STRUCTURE LSTRUCT:
       1 PROG NAME PROGRAM,
       1 TSK NAME TASK,
       1 LX INTEGER;
    DECLARE LSTRUCT LSTRUCT-STRUCTURE;
    DECLARE LY SCALAR;
 CLOSE COMPL;
